t-challenge/pull/6.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Added FILEBROWSER_ROOT environment variable to represent the root\r\n  directory from which to list entries for /api/filebrowser\r\n- Moved processing of environment variables into src/config.ts (now that\r\n  more than one file needs to access them)\r\n\r\nNote: this is using the `t/server/login` branch as a base because it depends on the session management implemented in that branch. I'll rebase to `main` once PR #4 is merged.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/6/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/6/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/5","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/5/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/5/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/5/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/5","id":1022881722,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGITaDc4tBv5b","number":5,"title":"Client Login implementation","user":{"login":"zship","id":151098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTA5OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship","html_url":"https://github.com/zship","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2021-10-11T16:01:42Z","updated_at":"2022-04-15T03:26:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/pulls/5","html_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/5","diff_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/5.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/5.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This includes:\r\n\r\n- Login form\r\n- A basic Router\r\n- A global store (src/store/index.ts). Used only for keeping track of\r\n  the `sessionId` as of this commit.\r\n- A wrapper for authenticated requests: `makeAuthenticatedRequest` (in\r\n  src/store/actions.ts). This will be used to keep the store's\r\n  `sessionId` in sync with the server when an authenticated request\r\n  indicates an invalid or expired sessionId. Note: there are no\r\n  authenticated requests yet; FileBrowser will have one\r\n  (`/api/filebrowser`).\r\n- A stub for the FileBrowser component. This is for Login to have\r\n  something to forward to on successful login.\r\n\r\n**Note:** this is using the `t/server/login` branch as a base because it depends on the `/api/login` endpoint. I'll rebase to `main` once PR #4 is merged.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/5/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/5/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/4","id":1020626181,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGITaDc4s7AU6","number":4,"title":"server /api/login endpoint","user":{"login":"zship","id":151098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTA5OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship","html_url":"https://github.com/zship","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zship/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2021-10-08T02:52:06Z","updated_at":"2022-04-15T03:26:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/pulls/4","html_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/zship/teleport-challenge/pull/4.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR implements the `/api/login` endpoint along with:\r\n\r\n1. Session management\r\n2. Unit tests and a test runner (because this is the first endpoint implementation). To run tests, use `yarn run tests`.\r\n3. Authn/authz for the `/api/filebrowser` endpoint. This is still a stub on success. It's only meant to demonstrate auth-related failure codes.\r\n\r\nA few nonautomated tests you can make against these endpoints are:\r\n\r\n```\r\n# run the server\r\n$ yarn run start\r\n\r\n# if you use HTTPie like I have in these examples, you'll need a concatenated certificate\r\n$ cat .keys/ca-cert.pem .keys/server-cert.pem > bundle.pem\r\n\r\n# a failed login\r\nhttp --verify=bundle.pem POST https://localhost:8443/api/login username=zach password=hunter3\r\n\r\n# login with a missing password param\r\nhttp --verify=bundle.pem POST https://localhost:8443/api/login username=zach\r\n\r\n# a successful login\r\nhttp --verify=bundle.pem POST https://localhost:8443/api/login username=zach password=hunter2\r\n\r\n# test a successfully-authenticated route\r\n$ http --verify=bundle.pem https://localhost:8443/api/filebrowser 'Session-Id:SESSION_ID_FROM_ABOVE_RESPONSE'\r\n\r\n# test an invalid session id\r\n$ http --verify=bundle.pem https://localhost:8443/api/filebrowser 'Session-Id:dummy'\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsers are currently hard-coded into `src/model/user.ts`. If you want to\r\ngenerate your own, I've provided a script to compute the salt and passwordHash:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ scripts/generate-user\r\nUsername: <input your username>\r\nPassword: <input your password>\r\n# output:\r\n{\r\n  username: 'zach',\r\n  salt: '7b2c4fb30a242346a359e90f94b043e8',\r\n  passwordHash: 'e9045ae274855d15433b1d5058206ea9def9c4c07041bffd8805d61fc5ab0fa1',\r\n  scopes: [ 'read:filebrowser' ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zship/teleport-challenge/issues/4/